    "updated_at": "2024-06-05T10:46:15Z",
    "body": "CSS Align added [`justify-items: legacy`](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-align/#valdef-justify-items-legacy) precisely to explain this behavior. So once browser implement that, the mapping should be\r\n\r\n - `<center>` and `<div align=\"center\">` into `justify-items: legacy center; text-align: center`\r\n - `<div align=\"left\">` into `justify-items: legacy left; text-align: left`\r\n - `<div align=\"right\">` into `justify-items: legacy right; text-align: right`",
